2 CONT
2 CONT Helen B. Heihn, 87, formerly of White Bear Lake, died May 16.
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded in death by husband Juell (1983); sister Arlene Hamilton; Loving mother of Sonja (Joe) Novak of Cedar Rapids, Greg Heihn of Bethel, and Kevin (Sandra) Heihn of Ham Lake; grandchildren Mike, Joe, Alisha, Alex, Kevin, Patri
2 CONC ck, Christopher, Sean, Annalise; great-grandchildren Preston, Elise, Sebastian.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survived by brothers Inman Hesla, Loren Hesla; sister Joyce Lee.
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorial service May 19 at 11 a.m. at Johnson-Peterson Funeral Home, 2130 2nd Street, White Bear Lake. Interment Evergreen Memorial Gardens
