1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hesla, Freida Rose Jackson DillonFreida Rose Jackson Dillon Hesla was a beloved wife, mother, sister, and grandmother who went peacefully to be with her Lord on March 2, 2009 surrounded by her loving family. Born i
2 CONC n Smackover, AR on April 7, 1930. Survived by her loving husband of 57 years, Loren N. Hesla and their 3 children Joy Gissler, husband Jim & family, Jeffrey Hesla, wife Toni, Jennifer Biernacki, husband Rick & family. Grandchildre
2 CONC n Joshua Jones, Heidi Hesla, Loren P. Hesla and Samantha Brooks. Also survived by sister Maye Myers & family, brother Robert Jackson & family and sisters-in-law & families. Preceded in death by parent's Annis and Ralph Jackson, ad
2 CONC opted parent's Mr. & Mrs. B.F. Dillon, 5 Jackson brothers & 1 sister and 2 Dillon brothers. Freida graduated from Baylor nursing School in 1950, eventually going on to become a real estate broker in Dallas and Hideaway Lake for ma
2 CONC ny years. She was one of the original founders of King of Glory Lutheran Church, where she served faithfully for 21 years in various capacities including the first female council president. Moved to Hideaway Lake in 1985 and were 
2 CONC she remained active at Our Saviors Lutheran Church in Tyler. The family would like to thank the FAITH Presbyterian Hospice for all their support. A Celebration of Life will be held to honor Freida's life at King of Glory (6411 LBJ
2 CONC  Freeway, Dallas, TX 75230) on March 5, 2009 at 1:00pm and a Memorial Service at Our Saviors Lutheran Church (4900 Kinsey Dr, Tyler Texas 75703) on March 7, 2009 at 1:00 pm. In lieu of flowers, donations in Freida's name may be ma
2 CONC de to Our Saviors Lutheran Church Building Fund or King of Glory's Parish Nursing fund. Freida will always be remembered as an accepting, caring, loving, spiritual woman and will be dearly missed by all who knew and loved her.  .
2 CONT
2 CONT Published in Dallas Morning News on Mar. 4, 2009  - See more at: http://www.legacy.com/obituaries/dallasmorningnews/obituary.aspx?n=freida-rose-hesla&pid=124865578#sthash.Pw9nEdIX.dpuf
