2 CONT ID: I14720 Name: Jon Pedersen HAUG 1 2 3 Sex: M Birth: 1898 in Hoyem Myran, Byneset, Norway 1 4 Death: BET. 1929 - 1998 in Skogn, Norway 1 3 Reference Number: 14720 Note:
