2 CONT
2 CONT Edna Halverson Lamp Stacy, age 92, died on August 15, 2007 in Medford, Oregon. Funeral services were held on August 20.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Stacy was born on Deer Creek in Sweet Grass County, Montana January 1, 1915. She attended Deer Creek school and graduated from SGHS.
2 CONT
2 CONT She and her husband, Lloyd Lamp, ranched for several years on the Old Boulder Road outside of Big Timber. They had four children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include Bob Stacy, her husband of 35 years; three children, numerous grand and great grandchildren; and one sister, Betty Jarrett, of Big Timber. http://boards.ancestry.co.uk/localities.northam.usa.states.montana.countie
